  {"why": "Ghazan's occupation of Syria (1299-1300) shown by Euratlas did not exist in 1291: Aleppo and northern Syria were Mamluk under al-Ashraf Khalil (Holt, The Age of the Crusades; Amitai-Preiss, Mongols and Mamluks).",
